Peter J Ley wrote:
>
> My question is, if I want to seriously start playing to ascend, should
> I concentrate on one role so I can get really good with it, or spread
> it around more to learn more general strategies?

I say a little of both.  Focus for bunch of games on the same class to
learn specific strategies then switch to another class with different
strengths to learn those.  Use specialization without getting stuck in
habits.  Use generalization without getting confused.

I end up playing a class a bunch of games, then switch to some other
class.


